---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Roadmap">
  <h2>v0.1 — Current</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Seamless inline WYSIWYG editing</li>
    <li>Folder workspace with file tree</li>
    <li>Document outline and command palette</li>
    <li>GFM: tables, task lists, code highlighting</li>
    <li>HTML export CLI</li>
    <li>macOS and Linux builds</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>v0.2</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Windows support</li>
    <li>Source mode toggle</li>
    <li>Formatting shortcuts (⌘B, ⌘I, ⌘K)</li>
    <li>Save As dialog</li>
    <li>Workspace-wide search</li>
    <li>Precise click-to-position caret</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>v0.3+</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Git status and diff in sidebar</li>
    <li>Plugin API (WASM)</li>
    <li>Custom keybindings</li>
    <li>AccessKit screen reader integration</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Future</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>MCP server for agent workflows</li>
    <li>Visual Markdown diffs</li>
    <li>Agent edit review mode</li>
  </ul>
  <p>See <code>ROADMAP.md</code> in the repository for the full plan.</p>
</DocsLayout>
